  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "Introduction",
      "text": "<div align=\"center\">"
    },
    {
      "section": "✨ One click. A clearer prompt.",
      "text": "Turn a rough idea into a focused prompt—right where you write. Enhance, cancel, or restore without leaving your conversation.\n\n[](LICENSE)\n\n**English** · [简体中文](README.zh-CN.md)\n\n</div>"
    },
    {
      "section": "From rough idea to ready-to-send",
      "text": "Ask a quick question, then enhance it into a clear request with useful context.\n\n<table>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\"><strong>BEFORE</strong></td>\n<td align=\"center\"><strong>AFTER</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"docs/images/prompt-before.png\" alt=\"A short question about a GitHub project\" width=\"480\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"docs/images/prompt-after.png\" alt=\"A detailed request for project analysis and usage instructions\" width=\"480\"></td>\n</tr>\n</table>"
    },
    {
      "section": "A simple three-state button",
      "text": "| ✨ Enhance | <img src=\"docs/images/enhancing-spinner.gif\" alt=\"Animated loading spinner\" width=\"20\"> Enhancing · click to cancel | ↺ Restore |\n|:--|:--|:--|\n| Rewrite your draft in place. | The animated spinner shows the request is running. | Bring back the original draft at any time after enhancement. |\n\nThe rewrite keeps your draft's language. Your text stays safe, too: if a request fails or you keep typing while it runs, the plugin won't replace it. File-reference chips are preserved."
    },
    {
      "section": "Uses your current DSH model",
      "text": "Enhancement follows the model selected for the conversation when you click ✨, using your existing DSH provider and API setup. **No separate API key or model setup is needed.** If the conversation has no model selection, the DSH host's default model is used."
    },
    {
      "section": "Get started",
      "text": "You need a working DSH installation and profile.\n\n1. Build the package:\n\n```bash\n   pnpm install\n   pnpm build\n   ```\n\n2. Add it to your profile's `package.json` and bundle list:\n\n```json\n   {\n     \"dependencies\": {\n       \"dsh-prompt-better\": \"link:<absolute path to this package>\"\n     },\n\n3. Restart DSH, type a draft, and click ✨ beside the chat input.\n\n<details>\n<summary>Optional: set a timeout or pin a model</summary>"
    },
    {
      "section": "Get started",
      "text": "Add this to your profile's `cordis.patch.yml`. Usually, no extra configuration is needed.\n\n```yaml\n- id: enhance-prompt\n  name: dsh-prompt-better\n  config:\n    timeoutMs: 120000\n\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>Development</summary>\n\n```bash\npnpm install\npnpm build\npnpm typecheck\n```\n\n</details>\n\n---\n\n<div align=\"center\">\n\n[Apache-2.0 License](LICENSE) · [简体中文](README.zh-CN.md)\n\n</div>"
    },
    {
      "section": "Introduction",
      "text": "<div align=\"center\">"
    },
    {
      "section": "✨ 一键把提示词说清楚",
      "text": "在输入框旁把简单想法扩写成清晰、具体的提示词。增强、取消或恢复原文，都不必离开当前对话。\n\n[](LICENSE)\n\n[English](README.md) · **简体中文**\n\n</div>"
    },
    {
      "section": "从简单想法到清晰提示词",
      "text": "先写下一句简单的问题，再一键补充成更明确、可直接使用的请求。\n\n<table>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\"><strong>增强前</strong></td>\n<td align=\"center\"><strong>增强后</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"docs/images/prompt-before.png\" alt=\"简单询问 GitHub 项目的用途\" width=\"480\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"docs/images/prompt-after.png\" alt=\"具体要求分析项目并提供使用说明\" width=\"480\"></td>\n</tr>\n</table>"
    },
    {
      "section": "一个按钮，三种状态",
      "text": "| ✨ 增强 | <img src=\"docs/images/enhancing-spinner.gif\" alt=\"动态加载动画\" width=\"20\"> 增强中 · 点击取消 | ↺ 恢复 |\n|:--|:--|:--|\n| 在原输入框中改写草稿。 | 动态转圈表示请求正在进行，点击即可取消。 | 增强完成后可随时恢复原文。 |\n\n改写会保留草稿原有的语言。请求失败，或增强过程中你继续编辑时，插件不会覆盖你的草稿；文件引用 chip 也会保留。"
    },
    {
      "section": "自动使用当前 DSH 模型",
      "text": "默认使用点击 ✨ 时当前对话选中的模型，并沿用 DSH 已配置的服务商和 API。**无需另配 API Key 或模型。** 如果当前对话没有模型选择，则使用 DSH Host 的默认模型。"
    },
    {
      "section": "快速开始",
      "text": "你需要先有可正常运行的 DSH 安装和 profile。\n\n1. 构建插件：\n\n```bash\n   pnpm install\n   pnpm build\n   ```\n\n2. 在 profile 的 `package.json` 中添加依赖和 bundle：\n\n```json\n   {\n     \"dependencies\": {\n       \"dsh-prompt-better\": \"link:<本插件的绝对路径>\"\n     },\n\n3. 重启 DSH，在输入框写下草稿并点击旁边的 ✨。\n\n<details>\n<summary>可选：调整超时或固定模型</summary>\n\n在 profile 的 `cordis.patch.yml` 中添加以下配置即可；通常无需额外配置。\n\n```yaml\n- id: enhance-prompt\n  name: dsh-prompt-better\n  config:\n    timeoutMs: 120000\n\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>开发</summary>"
    },
    {
      "section": "快速开始",
      "text": "```bash\npnpm install\npnpm build\npnpm typecheck\n```\n\n</details>\n\n---\n\n<div align=\"center\">\n\n[Apache-2.0 许可证](LICENSE) · [English](README.md)\n\n</div>"
    }
